OL,3,GNEWSAMechanic offered 'special serum'
OL,4,Ato husband who raped wife, court hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mechanic accused of plotting to drug
OL,7,Fand rape a man's wife offered the
OL,8,Fhusband a "special serum" to knock her
OL,9,Fout, a court has heard.
OL,11,FDaniel Rayner, 42, is one of nine men
OL,12,Ffacing various charges in relation to
OL,13,Fsex offences said to have been
OL,14,Fcommitted against a Stockport woman.
OL,16,FHer husband has already pleaded guilty
OL,17,Fto multiple offences dating back over
OL,18,F20 years, including rape, sexual
OL,19,Fassault and administering a substance
OL,20,Fwith intent to commit a sexual offence.
