OL,4,Ato husband who raped wife, court hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FRayner, of Whitstable in Kent, bought a
OL,7,F"sleeping liquid" packaged as "hair
OL,8,Fserum" from a website selling sexual
OL,9,Fwellness products and sleep-related
OL,10,Faids, Manchester Minshull Street Crown
OL,11,FCourt heard.
